{"availability":"available","full":"Sudharshan205-Proj/fraud-detection-system","name":"fraud-detection-system","description":"End-to-end fraud detection system built on the 6.36M-row PaySim1 dataset. Compares supervised classification and unsupervised anomaly detection, handles extreme class imbalance with class weighting, SMOTE and ADASYN, uses leakage-safe feature engineering and threshold optimization, and includes SHAP explainability and a Streamlit demo.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-22T09:34:59Z","updated":"2026-09-29T07:26:26Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://internship-fraud-detection-system.streamlit.app/","topics":["adasyn","anomaly-detection","classification","data-analysis","data-science","explainable-ai","financial-fraud","fraud-detection","imbalanced-learning","jupyter-notebook","machine-learning","paysim","python","random-forest","sckit-learn","shap","smote","streamlit","tensorflow","xgboost"],"demo":"https://internship-fraud-detection-system.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:44.306Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:44.306Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T15:50:44.306Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:21:19.879Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T09:23:36.035Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:00:59.965Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T15:50:44.306Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Data Science Internship Project — Codec Technologies","A post-transaction fraud-monitoring pipeline built on PaySim1, a 6.36-million-row synthetic mobile-money dataset. An eight-experiment comparison matrix plus a tuned XGBoost (nine candidates in all) — spanning anomaly detection (models fit on normal transactions only) and supervised classification, with three different imbalance-handling strategies — are compared head-to-head on the validation set before one final model is evaluated on the held-out test set.","Headline result: at its validation-chosen operating threshold, the final model (a tuned XGBoost) catches 99.59% of fraud with zero false positives (F1 = 0.9980, AUC-ROC = 0.9992) on 415,562 held-out test transactions."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sudharshan205-Proj/fraud-detection-system/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7a3e2ffcc4ff57329ff0ee0193724d0271188c676af8067d87ff2f3f8c007ecf","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:20.059Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T03:02:19.283Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Data Science Internship Project — Codec Technologies","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sudharshan205-Proj/fraud-detection-system/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7a3e2ffcc4ff57329ff0ee0193724d0271188c676af8067d87ff2f3f8c007ecf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sudharshan205-Proj/fraud-detection-system/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T03:02:19.283Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T07:26:26Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Sudharshan205-Proj/fraud-detection-system/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T03:02:19.284Z","hash":"7a3e2ffcc4ff57329ff0ee0193724d0271188c676af8067d87ff2f3f8c007ecf","originalBytes":29993,"storedBytes":29993,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:21:19.879Z","subjects":["Science"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":["Science"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Science","source":"metadata","match":"science"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Mobile","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://internship-fraud-detection-system.streamlit.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-14T08:31:45.608Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-14T08:31:45.608Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-